@startuml Staking Flow

' Стилизация как в новой диаграмме
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam padding 5
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    ActorBorderColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BoxBorderColor #2C3E50
    BoxBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    NoteBorderColor #2C3E50
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    GroupBorderColor #2C3E50
    GroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

actor Пользователь as User
participant "Фронтенд\n(React)" as Frontend
participant "Бэкенд\n(Laravel)" as Backend
participant "TON Бэкенд\n(Express)" as TONBackend
participant "StakeMaster\nКонтракт" as StakeMaster
participant "Stake\nКонтракт" as Stake

' Стейкинг токенов
group Процесс стейкинга
    User -> Frontend: Нажатие "Стейк токенов"
    Frontend -> Backend: POST /lootboxes/stake\n{amount, duration, mint_count, max_claims}
    Backend -> TONBackend: POST /stake\n{owner, amount, out_amount, mint_count, duration, max_claims}
    TONBackend -> StakeMaster: TokenNotification\n{amount, forward_payload: Deposit}
    StakeMaster -> Stake: Деплой нового Stake контракта\n{amount, out_amount, stake_time, mint_count, max_claims}
    StakeMaster --> TONBackend: Адрес контракта
    TONBackend --> Backend: {body, to, value}
    Backend --> Frontend: Данные транзакции
    Frontend -> User: Показать статус транзакции
end

' Клейм наград
group Получение наград
    User -> Frontend: Нажатие "Получить награду"
    Frontend -> Backend: POST /lootboxes/claim\n{id}
    Backend -> TONBackend: POST /claim\n{address, owner_address}
    TONBackend -> Stake: Claim\n{query_id, owner_address, wallet_address}
    Stake -> StakeMaster: DoMint\n{amount: out_amount, mint_count}
    StakeMaster -> User: Отправка награды
    StakeMaster --> TONBackend: Успех
    TONBackend --> Backend: Статус транзакции
    Backend --> Frontend: Обновление UI
    Frontend -> User: Показать сообщение об успехе
end

' Рестейк
group Рестейк
    User -> Frontend: Нажатие "Рестейк"
    Frontend -> Backend: POST /lootboxes/restake\n{id}
    Backend -> TONBackend: POST /restake\n{address, owner_address}
    TONBackend -> Stake: Restake\n{query_id}
    Stake -> Stake: Сброс claims_count\nОбновление next_claim
    Stake --> TONBackend: Успех
    TONBackend --> Backend: Статус транзакции
    Backend --> Frontend: Обновление UI
    Frontend -> User: Показать сообщение об успехе
end

' Вывод стейка
group Вывод стейка
    User -> Frontend: Нажатие "Вывод"
    Frontend -> Backend: POST /lootboxes/withdraw\n{id}
    Backend -> TONBackend: POST /stake/withdraw\n{address, owner_address}
    TONBackend -> Stake: Withdraw\n{query_id, wallet_address}
    Stake -> StakeMaster: DoMint\n{amount: full_amount, mint_count: 0}
    StakeMaster -> User: Отправка токенов
    Stake -> Stake: Установка is_active = false
    Stake --> TONBackend: Успех
    TONBackend --> Backend: Статус транзакции
    Backend --> Frontend: Обновление UI
    Frontend -> User: Показать сообщение об успехе
end

@enduml
